Reflection as an intrinsic/extrinsic is always nice to have, of
course, but there are several alternatives.  You should blind yourself
(preferably not with pie or camera, a more reliable way, like a
blindfold, is best) and find another way to kill her.  Once you are
blind, her stoning gaze is no longer a threat, and you can take her
down like any other monster.  However, you can take advantage of her
stoning gaze by using reflection, or by applying a mirror ("looking
glass") on her.  Bouncing ray attacks off walls could possibly take
her down safely, without even needing to blind yourself (not
recommended, since playing around with insta-death is never a good
idea, but for the unfortunate soul who doesn't have reflection OR
blindfold by this point...)

Anyways, just be sure not to be blind, and it's pretty safe after
that.

